WEBVTT

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:42.290
You'll be dead in no time.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:51.880
The limiter's been released!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.010
Kouga-kun, are you OK?

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.390
No problem.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.350
It should be putting quite a burden on your body.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.020
Is it painful anywhere?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.020
It feels great.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.440
I feel like my body's been revitalised.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.650
We can change the system at any time!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.240
We'll react to things immediately.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.950
Right, thanks.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.160
What's your name?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.370
I'm Hashimoto Mayu.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.910
Mayu-san.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.920
Such unpleasant things happened to you because of me.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.420
I hope you'll be able to forget them as soon as possible!

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.800
Y-Yes.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.430
I'm going.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.940
Episode 12: The Red Stake

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.650
It's dangerous!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.570
You should stay here.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.070
I have to go.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.950
I need to see things for myself.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.500
I'm sorry to bother you.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.920
You weren't a bother at all!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.710
Come by any time!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.710
I'll be here!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.850
How nice!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.350
Those are the eyes of a Player.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.480
Hate me.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.830
Become a Player.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.040
What's this?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.390
The red stone's turned into this.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.110
Kanzaki wanted to turn you into a human,

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:19.570
so why did he leave something like this behind?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.820
Maybe he wanted to see you in your complete form.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:33.000
What would you... possibly understand about Jii-chan?!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:41.510
You can't beat me without obtaining your complete form...

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.510
Ever!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.010
Farewell, Kanzaki Jin.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.990
A-Amazing!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.540
Hayami and Jirou-san were no good.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.880
Kouga...

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.390
Hang in there!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.600
Take the... stake from him.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.140
Stake?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.690
That's... the red stone!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.610
Alphas!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.620
Kill that man!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.000
What?!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.630
He's the perpetrator of the destruction of our home!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.040
Shooting Mode.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.510
You don't understand anything!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.600
Jin is our ally!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.520
I should shoot the source of all this evil...

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.560
In other words, you!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.270
You're the one who doesn't understand!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.400
Stop!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:34.030
If I let him live, even more people will die after this!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.910
Aim for Alphas!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.790
But Mr. President...

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:42.130
Did you not hear me?!

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.500
Aim!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.090
Those guys are your brothers.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:56.310
They're a mass-produced type created from Hayami's data about you.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.310
I have plenty left to replace you.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:04.190
You can't stop Alphas from spreading his wings on the field of battle...

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.900
...just by shooting me!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.570
You're going to drag Alphas's name into the dirt?!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:11.860
No!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.340
Kouga...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.140
Have you lost it?!

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.010
You!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.510
You're next!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:42.140
For allying yourself with Amagi Seizou to cause chaos to humanity!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.690
Aren't humans the ones causing chaos?

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.900
Everybody else thinks so, too!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.870
From now on, it's the age of the Players.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.090
You can't!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.930
It's an emergency situation!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.430
I'm a member of the Amagi family!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.930
My father and brother are in there!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.520
Please let me through!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.100
Are you really an Amagi?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.940
I really want to be with them.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.190
I have to go!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.820
It's dangerous!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.070
Get back.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.030
All the cameras on-location have been wiped out.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.330
There are too many Players!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.540
Will Kouga's body be able to hold out...?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.980
Stop...

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.650
Stop it!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.960
Get away!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.180
Everyone, stay near me!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.020
What can you do all by yourself?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.530
This is bad!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.650
He's taking a lot of damage.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.860
At this rate, the limiter will start itself.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.410
If it does, he won't be able to fight!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.120
Kouga-kun will have nothing left but his own willpower...

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.250
Um...

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.330
What's going to happen to Kouga-kun?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.130
We don't know right now.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.710
As far as we know, Alphas is in uncharted territory right now.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.220
T-That's not what I meant.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.970
He shot his own father and mother, didn't he?

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.520
Shooting Mode.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:42.660
Konoha!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.370
Oh my, oh my... Another guest!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:49.870
You can't go now.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.790
Konoha... Stay back!

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.380
What a huge crisis...

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.800
The humans and the white one are all going to die.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.050
I won't let anyone die.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:09.310
That stake is the life given to you by Kanzaki.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.560
If you don't stab yourself with it, you'll die soon.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.440
And then you can't save anyone.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.110
If you stab yourself with the stake,

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.280
you can be reborn in your complete form.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:27.080
In other words, you'll become our Charisma, mankind's enemy!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.330
Zetman is... the enemy?!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.090
I could also say it like this:

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.590
You'd become the Players' "justice".

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:42.470
According to us, humans are the evil ones.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.680
They're nothing but monsters like that guy,

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:49.850
greedy people who think of others as less than human.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:55.690
Where's the need for us to join with them?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.610
Go on and rip evil to pieces, Zet.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.860
Hurry up and stab yourself with the stake!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.570
Jin!

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.490
You're not something evil!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.700
You can't listen to what he's saying!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:09.910
Jin!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.040
You can't!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.870
The second the Red Stone was passed over to him,

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.540
it was stained by evil!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.630
We don't know what kind of trap he may have set up!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.050
Even so...

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.010
If I die, I can't save anybody.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.190
Are you choosing the path of evil?!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.150
Jin-kun, do your best.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.910
You can't save anyone like that, can you?

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.340
Jin!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.510
Hanako!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.850
He's going to die pretty soon.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.100
What?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.860
Haitani, you-

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.820
Jin!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:30.240
You can't save her if you don't stab yourself with the stake.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.000
You want to save humans, don't you?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.660
Stop!

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.090
Just try killing Hanako.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:54.270
I'll slaughter all of you!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.690
Stop it!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:14.200
If I turn evil, kill me.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.420
The complete... form...

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.560
Jin-kun is...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.520
That's...

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:12.950
Don't worry.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.740
I feel great.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.450
Hanako!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.460
What?

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.430
No! My head... hurts...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.850
Players.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:44.060
Throw away this ugly human form.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.440
Return to your true self.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.150
Liberate all of your powers!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:54.110
We're free!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:16:59.990
Hanako!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.960
Jin... Save me!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.980
Your Ring of Exposure...

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.650
It reacts when you're close to Players.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.070
It causes them to revert by force.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:36.320
Furthermore, they can't return to their human forms!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.080
That girl was...

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.710
Isn't this way better?

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.340
We don't have to be slaves to the humans anymore.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.810
Feel like being a hero?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.020
I'll enforce justice!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.790
The sand monster!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.930
Father...!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.720
No!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.990
Tanaka-kun, you've really gained some weight.

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.700
If you don't do anything about that girl,

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.700
she'll turn everybody into sand.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.830
Don't mess with me!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.250
You have my thanks, red guy!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.710
Just like I thought, this is the real me!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.140
Shut up.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.100
Got you!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:04.260
A Player forced to revert by of the Ring of Exposure can never become human again!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.810
That's right, she'll look like this for the rest of her life.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.650
Remember?

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:22.320
Whenever you guys were together, I was always close by.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.870
Is that your girlfriend?

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.330
You should take good care of her.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:36.000
I set up your meeting.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:47.850
The spirit of being human that Kanzaki taught to you...

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.270
I took on continuing that lesson...

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.020
...and that's what she is.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.640
Are you OK?!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.020
Okaa-san, open your eyes!

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.900
Konoha...

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.190
Okaa-san!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:06.160
You guys tried to become a family like humans.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.160
I can't help being worried about you.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:15.960
I want to be here.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.540
I'm happy!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.550
I want us to... be a family!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:30.010
But Tanaka falling in love with you...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.060
...was a trick, of course.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:37.810
"Family" sounds more and more like a lie, doesn't it?

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.480
What Kanzaki tried to teach you...

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.030
...was how hearts are easily tricked,

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:47.450
and how cruel and shallow humans are!

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.290
Like I can believe that.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:02.340
You think I believe that?!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:16.230
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:23.070
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:29.320
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:36.000
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:45.550
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.390
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:58.230
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:09.700
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:17.290
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:28.720
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:40.050
Isn't your job to hunt the Players?

00:23:40.050 --> 00:23:42.020
It's what Kanzaki wished for.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:42.900
Funeral Procession

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.880
Do your job!
Funeral Procession

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:45.470
Funeral Procession
